2022 Iran’s economic record is mostly a mix of ruler rhetoric about production and self-reliance against a backdrop of sanctions, inflation, subsidy stress, and distributional strain. The local priors already show a large economy with weak per-capita income and no need to re-fetch the structured datasets.

